{'symbol': 'HBAN', 'date': '2022-07-21 16:30:00', 'title': 'HUNTINGTON BANCSHARES INCORPORATED DECLARES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDENDS ON ITS COMMON AND PREFERRED STOCKS', 'text': "COLUMBUS, OHIO , JULY 21, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- HUNTINGTON BANCSHARES INCORPORATED ANNOUNCED THAT THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND ON THE COMPANY'S COMMON STOCK (NASDAQ: HBAN) OF $0.155 PER COMMON SHARE, UNCHANGED FROM THE PRIOR QUARTER.\xa0 THE COMMON STOCK CASH DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE OCTOBER 3, 2022, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON SEPTEMBER 19, 2022."}{'symbol': 'HBAN', 'date': '2022-07-21 07:00:00', 'title': 'HUNTINGTON BANCSHARES INCORPORATED REPORTS 2022 SECOND-QUARTER EARNINGS', 'text': 'DELIVERS RECORD NET INCOME AND ACHIEVEMENT OF MEDIUM-TERM FINANCIAL TARGETS NET INTEREST INCOME INCREASED 10% SEQUENTIALLY AND CONTINUED EXPENSE REDUCTIONS DRIVE RECORD PPNR 2022 SECOND-QUARTER HIGHLIGHTS: EARNINGS PER COMMON SHARE (EPS) FOR THE QUARTER WERE $0.35, AN INCREASE OF $0.06 FROM THE PRIOR QUARTER. EXCLUDING $0.01 PER COMMON SHARE AFTER-TAX OF NOTABLE ITEMS, ADJUSTED EARNINGS PER COMMON SHARE WERE $0.36.'}